### Frontend Component (React & Tailwind CSS)

#### [NEW] [src/services/apiClient.js](file:///d:/sih/patient-case-taking/frontend/doctor/src/services/apiClient.js)
- Axios client configured with `baseURL = import.meta.env.VITE_API_BASE_URL || 'http://localhost:8000/api/v1'`.
- Request interceptor: Automatically extracts JWT token from `localStorage` and appends `Authorization: Bearer <token>`.
- Response interceptor: Normalizes standard error formats (`401 Unauthorized`, `404 Not Found`, `422 Validation Error`).
- Resilient fallback wrapper for zero-crash degradation.

